{"synopsis":"Dokter bedah toraks, Lee Jinhyuk, telah mendedikasikan puluhan tahun hidupnya hanya untuk pasiennya. Namun, dia tidak bisa berada di sana untuk saat-saat terakhir ibunya sendiri, menghabiskan malam-malam tanpa tidur yang penuh dengan penyesalan. Namun, ketika ia terbangun, tiba-tiba saja bulan Februari 1998-kembali ke masa-masa magangnya! Di kehidupan keduanya, ia ingin mencurahkan waktunya sepenuhnya untuk keluarganya… Namun, apa pun yang dilakukannya, hidup tenang bukanlah sebuah pilihan!","alternative_title":"회귀 닥터는 조용히 살고 싶었다, Dokter Yang Hidup Kembali Agar Bisa Hidup Dengan Tenang","author":"Tauran, Haejun, BY","artist":"Drawways","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"3d2d616f-811e-48e5-a23d-b28a14cd9c0c","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06"},{"chapter_id":"4a239ecf-7553-41d8-b854-349735994e4f","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23"},{"chapter_id":"7eef8d01-bd24-43d1-9a11-5e72ff684047","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2026-06-16","released":"2026-06-16"},{"chapter_id":"8bffe8ac-6ac6-4d45-b0a2-b1ccc6ae3ed5","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"62a19375-23fd-47cd-beae-95b28cfcb79f","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"183494ef-a37e-4241-858b-70f2706076b6","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"6b4e5bcf-c0bf-48f2-ba81-65bd7453d988","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2026-05-26","released":"2026-05-26"},{"chapter_id":"d02d263d-08cb-478d-b9a7-bf97105a8e9f","number":"66","chapter":"66","title":"","date":"2026-05-24","released":"2026-05-24"},{"chapter_id":"bed8197e-507b-4a1c-a393-7cd1ed59d87d","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"","date":"2026-05-18","released":"2026-05-18"},{"chapter_id":"bab04894-b29c-436b-ae08-49d3a8ccd875","number":"64","chapter":"64","title"